# .semgrepignore for contracts directory
# Exclude known safe patterns and directories from Semgrep scans within the contracts/ folder.

# Build artifacts and dependencies
**/out/**
**/cache/**
**/broadcast/**
**/lib/**

# Generated code that is not manually audited
**/src/pool/verifier/**
**/src/crypto/generated/**

# Test and script files — bad patterns are expected and accepted here
**/test/**
**/script/**
